*VERSION: 3.0
*WRITTEN_BY: openair-conformance
* Tests: a ring-shaped airspace made of DB arcs. The outer circle (20 NM, clockwise), a connecting line, the inner circle (10 NM, counter-clockwise) and the same connecting line back.

AC UNC
AY CUSTOM
AN Outside competition circle
AH FL95
AL GND
V X=46:10:00N 014:10:00E
DB 46:30:00N 014:10:00E, 45:50:00N 014:10:00E
DB 45:50:00N 014:10:00E, 46:30:00N 014:10:00E
DP 46:20:00N 014:10:00E
V D=-
DB 46:20:00N 014:10:00E, 46:00:00N 014:10:00E
DB 46:00:00N 014:10:00E, 46:20:00N 014:10:00E
DP 46:30:00N 014:10:00E
